# Tests for Ptc_family: Table 2 in full (issue #32)

Every row of Table 2, "Applicable Figure", of the Instructions for Form 8962
(2024) (`sources/forms-instructions/i8962--2024.pdf` p 10), plus the rows "less
than 150" and "400 or more". The 250 printed rows (150 to 399) were extracted
from the PDF text (generated, not derived from the rule in
`catala/ptc_family.catala_en`). For each row the test takes a single filer in
the 48 states (poverty line $14,580), picks the smallest whole-dollar
household income whose Worksheet 2 percentage is the row
(`ceiling(row * 145.80)`; 400 is exactly $58,320, 401 is one dollar above 4
times the line) and asserts both the percentage and the figure.

> Using Types
> Using Ptc_family as F

